1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:01,733
Murid Xu Yan,

2
00:00:02,591 --> 00:00:03,845
lembar ujian saya ditukar!

3
00:00:03,905 --> 00:00:04,620
Yang memukul genderang,

4
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:06,689
naik ke balai sidang!

5
00:00:07,926 --> 00:00:09,353
Aku panggil Guru Besar.

6
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:13,735
Kau bilang lembar ujianmu ditukar;

7
00:00:13,804 --> 00:00:14,371
mana buktinya?

8
00:00:15,119 --> 00:00:16,061
Peringkat teratas itu,

9
00:00:16,242 --> 00:00:16,877
saya yang menulisnya.

10
00:00:17,641 --> 00:00:18,914
Tulisan tangan di lembar ini

11
00:00:19,758 --> 00:00:22,301
milik Wei Xun.

12
00:00:22,383 --> 00:00:23,125
Wei Xun,

13
00:00:23,445 --> 00:00:23,997
apa katamu?

14
00:00:24,575 --> 00:00:25,949
Hati saya bersih.

15
00:00:26,454 --> 00:00:29,166
Sarjana dari desa

16
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,700
gila ingin jadi juara pertama ujian provinsi.

17
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,882
Memfitnah penguji:

18
00:00:34,455 --> 00:00:37,354
tiga puluh pukulan, gelar dicabut!

19
00:00:39,004 --> 00:00:39,545
Tulisan bisa ditiru,

20
00:00:39,884 --> 00:00:40,724
karangan tidak.

21
00:00:41,623 --> 00:00:42,691
Tuan, beri kami kertas dan kuas,

22
00:00:42,788 --> 00:00:43,557
kami tulis dari ingatan di sini.

23
00:00:44,498 --> 00:00:45,504
Konyol!

24
00:00:45,625 --> 00:00:46,222
Usir dia!

25
00:00:48,638 --> 00:00:49,343
Orang yang memukul genderang,

26
00:00:49,886 --> 00:00:51,591
saya mau dengar.

27
00:00:52,417 --> 00:00:53,316
Waktunya satu batang dupa.

28
00:00:53,997 --> 00:00:54,748
Mulai.

29
00:00:57,269 --> 00:00:58,366
Air diangkat dengan kincir,

30
00:00:58,917 --> 00:01:00,637
tanpa menunggu langit.

31
00:01:01,463 --> 00:01:01,891
Permisi,

32
00:01:02,414 --> 00:01:03,400
Guru Besar Cheng datang!

33
00:01:03,647 --> 00:01:04,549
Saya yang menjamin,

34
00:01:04,883 --> 00:01:06,063
saya datang mendengar.

35
00:01:06,405 --> 00:01:07,325
Guru Besar Cheng,

36
00:01:07,821 --> 00:01:08,699
silakan duduk.

37
00:01:10,009 --> 00:01:10,927
Sama persis?

38
00:01:11,413 --> 00:01:12,755
Matanya cekung kebiruan,

39
00:01:13,226 --> 00:01:15,229
semalaman tidak tidur.

40
00:01:15,309 --> 00:01:16,101
Menghafal semalaman,

41
00:01:16,524 --> 00:01:18,023
kasihan kau.

42
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:19,942
Hafalkan.

43
00:01:20,123 --> 00:01:21,413
Kita lihat sampai mana.

44
00:01:24,805 --> 00:01:25,750
Sama persis.

45
00:01:26,267 --> 00:01:27,292
Memfitnah penguji,

46
00:01:27,990 --> 00:01:28,856
tiga puluh pukulan!

47
00:01:31,243 --> 00:01:32,933
Tertib——

48
00:01:33,086 --> 00:01:34,167
di persidangan——

49
00:01:34,961 --> 00:01:35,720
Xu Yan!
